      "bytes": 632,
      "literal_visible_passage": "The Company presents net revenue by geographic area, based upon the location of the original equipment manufacturers\u2019 (\u201cOEMs\u201d) headquarters, and by sales channel, as it believes that doing so best depicts how the nature, amount, timing, and uncertainty of revenue and cash flows are affected by economic factors. Individually insignificant OEMs are presented based upon the location of the Company\u2019s direct customer, which is typically a distributor.",
